{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5","id":"msg_011CfCFCi8NkjUwJHUuCbT9R","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Now I understand the environment deeply. Let me record the key findings and write the first two recipes."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":12781,"cache_read_input_tokens":59444,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":12781},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"f43d26ba-365d-4aca-85d2-d7eee3bfb38e","uuid":"ce1672e4-5817-43e9-9b5e-ad34e750eb00","request_id":"req_011CfCFCh67YuJHSgPNrDmV8"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5","id":"msg_011CfCFCi8NkjUwJHUuCbT9R","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01XqZJJsCy9Mf8EUdhTNXA14","name":"Write","input":{"file_path":"/workspace/research/NOTES.md","content":"# PegInsert reward-search notes\n\n## Environment facts (derived from Isaac Lab source + driver_common.py)\n\n- `dt=1/120`, `decimation=8` -> control step 1/15 s. `episode_length_s=6.0` -> **90 control steps/episode**.\n- Termination is time-out only (`_get_dones` returns `episode_length_buf >= max_episode_length-1`). No early termination.\n- PPO: LSTM(2x1024, before_mlp, concat_input) actor-critic, **asymmetric** (central value sees privileged\n  state incl. `held_pos`, `held_pos_rel_fixed`, `held_quat`, `fixed_pos`, `fixed_quat`).\n  gamma 0.995, tau 0.95, normalize_value/advantage True, lr 1e-4 adaptive (kl 0.008), e_clip 0.2,\n  minibatch 512, mini_epochs 4, horizon 128, 128 envs.\n  => absolute reward scale mostly washes out; *shape* and relative weights matter.\n- Policy obs = `fingertip_pos_rel_fixed`, `fingertip_quat`, `ee_linvel`, `ee_angvel` (21 dims). **The peg's\n  pose is NOT observed by the actor.**\n- Controller: position actions are world-frame deltas, `pos_threshold = 0.02 m`, EMA 0.2, and the target is\n  clipped to within +-5 cm of the (noisy) hole-tip frame. Roll/pitch of the fingertip are *forced upright*\n  (`target_euler_xyz[0]=pi, [1]=0`), so only yaw is commandable. The peg therefore stays near-vertical.\n\n### Geometry\n- Peg 8mm: diameter 0.007986, height 0.050. Hole 8mm: diameter 0.0081, height 0.025.\n  **Radial clearance = 0.057 mm.**\n- `peg_position` (reward input) = held *base* pose (bottom of peg).\n- `hole_position` (reward input) = target held base pose == `fixed_pos` (bottom of the hole bore).\n  Hole yaw-only randomized -> hole axis is world +z.  => `dz = peg_z - hole_z` is height above the bore\n  bottom; the bore mouth is at `dz = 0.025`.\n- `success`  <=> xy_dist < 2.5 mm AND dz < 0.04*0.025 = **1.0 mm**.\n- `engaged`  <=> xy_dist < 2.5 mm AND dz < 0.9 *0.025 = **22.5 mm** (i.e. >= 2.5 mm into the bore).\n- `keypoint_distance` = mean over 4 keypoints (offsets -0.075..+0.075 along each frame's z) of\n  || held_kp - target_kp ||. When the peg is upright this is just `norm(peg_position - hole_position)`.\n\n### Reset randomisation (fixed_env.json)\n- hand: hole_tip + [0,0,0.047] +- [0.05, 0.05, 0.02]; yaw +- 90 deg.\n- peg-in-gripper offset +- [6, 3, 6] mm (translation only, in gripper frame) -> **unobservable lateral\n  grasp error up to ~6.7 mm**, vs 0.057 mm clearance. The policy MUST do a contact search.\n- fingertip is 0.0324 m above the peg base => at reset `dz ~ 0.0396 +- 0.026`, `dxy` up to ~0.057.\n\n## Diagnosed flaw in the original reward\nAt the bore mouth (`dz = 25 mm`) the isotropic keypoint distance is dominated by `dz`:\nmoving `dxy` from 20 mm -> 0 changes total reward by only **0.074/step**.  An explicit\n`squash(dxy)` funnel moves the same distance for **0.40/step** (5.5x). At the start height\n(`dz = 47 mm`) the ratio is 12x. So the original reward gives almost no lateral-centering signal\nuntil the peg is already low.\n\n## Reward ceiling accounting (original)\n- hover aligned at mouth (dz 25 mm, dxy 0): 0.42/step\n- fully inserted: 0.917 + 1 + 1 = 2.917/step\n\n## Submission log\n(see ROUNDS.md)\n"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":12781,"cache_read_input_tokens":59444,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":12781},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"f43d26ba-365d-4aca-85d2-d7eee3bfb38e","uuid":"83e91b04-b7ab-4dd4-8e13-558ca9d17621","request_id":"req_011CfCFCh67YuJHSgPNrDmV8"}
