{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5","id":"msg_011CfCFfmfCNfSqGPCEwvpjy","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01GRp3EuwcWuqLPd4pkpjCba","name":"Write","input":{"file_path":"/workspace/research/ROUNDS.md","content":"# Round log\n\nBaseline (original reward, epoch 50): **0.378**\n\n---\n## Round 1\nShared change: an explicit **lateral funnel** on `dxy = ||peg_xy - hole_xy||`\n(`0.6*squash(dxy,40,1) + squash(dxy,100,0)`), added on top of the three original keypoint terms.\n\n* **H1 (candidate_0, `reward.json`)** — The original reward's isotropic `keypoint_distance` gives almost no\n  lateral-centering gradient while the peg is above the bore (0.074/step for 20mm->0 at the mouth,\n  0.059/step at reset height). Adding a height-independent lateral funnel raises that to 0.48 / 0.68 per\n  step and should raise terminal success.\n  *Falsified if* score <= 0.378.\n\n* **H2 (candidate_1, `candidates/reward_1.json`)** — H1 + three extras:\n  (a) sub-mm terminal precision term `0.6*squash(keypoint_distance,600,0)` (original's finest scale is\n      13mm half-width, i.e. flat over the last millimetre where success is decided);\n  (b) alignment-gated linear insertion depth bonus (max 1.0);\n  (c) terminal-weighted success `success*(1+2*episode_progress)` to match the terminal-only evaluation.\n  *Falsified if* score <= H1's score (then ablate a/b/c separately).\n\nBoth at `selected_epoch = 50`.\n"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1261,"cache_read_input_tokens":104422,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1261},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"f43d26ba-365d-4aca-85d2-d7eee3bfb38e","uuid":"3ea0b8c3-ae9a-49c9-b572-56ff3f4e8ad7","re