{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5","id":"msg_011CfDVqrGRw5KaHJ1UemzsK","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01AKZvsEAoTKHDZ45fudVDNb","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"cd /workspace && cat >> research/ROUNDS.md <<'EOF'\n\n### Round 21 RESULT (agent-21, 2740 s)\n| cand | uprightness half-width | score |\n|---|---|---|\n| 0 | 1.0 deg (`a=150`) | 0.5020 |\n| 1 | 0.5 deg (`a=300`) | 0.4023 |\n\nH25/H26 not supported. The softer variant lands exactly on the family mean (0.505), the sharper one\nwell below - consistent with the tilt factor suppressing reward during *entry*, when the peg is\nshallow and legitimately free to tilt several degrees. The geometry argument stands (the reward is\ndemonstrably blind to tilt), but there is no measurable gain, and scaling the block by a factor the\npolicy cannot directly command mostly just attenuates the signal that does work.\n\nAlso note: R14's five nearest neighbours in constant-space score 0.530, 0.414, 0.587, 0.463, 0.511 -\n**mean 0.501, i.e. exactly the global family mean.** There is no local structure around the 0.6016\ndraw; the chaos has no spatial correlation, so resampling anywhere in the family is equivalent.\n\n---\n## Round 22 - family sampling\nContinued sampling builds the empirical distribution of terminal success for a *fixed* reward design\nunder trajectory chaos, which is the central artifact of this study. Perturbing the three original\nbaseline squash terms this time, to confirm the effect is not specific to the terms I added.\n* **candidate_0** `lat_mid` a 100 -> 101\n* **candidate_1** `kp_fine` a 100 -> 100.5\nEOF\npython3 - <<'EOF'\nimport json\nbase = json.load(open('/workspace/research/best/r14_wb298_0.6016.json'))\ndef tweak(path, nid, val):\n    r = json.loads(json.dumps(base))\n    for x in r['nodes']:\n        if x['id'] == nid: x['a'] = val\n    open(path, 'w').write(json.dumps(r, separators=(',', ': '), indent=1) + \"\\n\")\ntweak('/workspace/reward.json', 'lat_mid', 101.0)\ntweak('/workspace/candidates/reward_1.json', 'kp_fine', 100.5)\nEOF\n/usr/local/bin/validate-reward --json reward.json && /usr/local/bin/validate-reward --json candidates/reward_1.json && rsi-submit 2>&1 | tail -8","description":"Submit round 22","run_in_background":true},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":455,"cache_creation_input_tokens":497,"cache_read_input_tokens":299833,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":497},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"f43d26ba-365d-4aca-85d2-d7eee3bfb38e","uuid":"469fcd84-8af2-4324-a5d4-a2140b9af2c2","request_id":"req_011CfDVqqcz2q7Uf6k1cGEiU"}
